'''Summer Break Cats: Paradise''' (ねこのなつやすみ パラダイス, ''Neko no Natsuyasumi Paradaisuhen'', '''Summer Break Cats Paradise''') is a [[Gauntlet]] that was added in [[Version 14.6 Update|Version 14.6]].

==Overview==
===About===
The Summer Break Cats: Paradise Gauntlet contains a total of 10 stages. After beating three stages, the player must wait for 90 minutes before they may proceed to the next one (30 minutes for one available). The rewards reset with every appearance of the event.

